{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bullet Hell STG with a Literally \u201cDiagonal\u201d Evolution!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an original bullet-hell STG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can freely move around during stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a Japanese-style townscape, girls clash in fierce battles with bullet barrages and close-range attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using melee attacks, you can erase enemy bullets, and with the points you earn, purchase items and upgrades\u2014so even players who struggle with bullet hell can feel at ease (probably).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go wild with powerful weapons earned through multiple playthroughs, or if you\u2019re confident in your skills, experience the thrill of dodging everything with pure technique!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Weapons with Personality</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses in rematches and earn original weapons as rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss provides weapons with different special effects and stats, such as attack power and charge speed, with randomized values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The upper and lower limits of these random stats can be checked in the in-game \u300c\u308a\u30fc\u3069\u307f\u30fc\u300d section.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084630?t=1760022652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084630/e674467a6c99465ec150bb6cfa5b083377412d6d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760022652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084630/a6a043baf1ac90782d83a899c1f3ab99d3efb863/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760022652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084630/a6a043baf1ac90782d83a899c1f3ab99d3efb863/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760022652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bullet Hell STG with a Literally \u201cDiagonal\u201d Evolution!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an original bullet-hell STG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can freely move around during stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a Japanese-style townscape, girls clash in fierce battles with bullet barrages and close-range attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using melee attacks, you can erase enemy bullets, and with the points you earn, purchase items and upgrades\u2014so even players who struggle with bullet hell can feel at ease (probably).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go wild with powerful weapons earned through multiple playthroughs, or if you\u2019re confident in your skills, experience the thrill of dodging everything with pure technique!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Weapons with Personality</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses in rematches and earn original weapons as rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss provides weapons with different special effects and stats, such as attack power and charge speed, with randomized values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The upper and lower limits of these random stats can be checked in the in-game \u300c\u308a\u30fc\u3069\u307f\u30fc\u300d section.</p>","developers":["\u3055\u306a\u3048\uff26"],"dlc":[4084790],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st